    "detailed_description": "<h1>Let's Develop Together</h1><p></p><br><h1>Add To Wishlist</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972810/extras/ef801e9a31df2a3981de029cdb7bb4bf.avif?t=1666986872\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972810/extras/62f57bf7b64de6588144fec3ef557a3a.poster.avif?t=1666986872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972810/extras/62f57bf7b64de6588144fec3ef557a3a.webm?t=1666986872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972810/extras/62f57bf7b64de6588144fec3ef557a3a.mp4?t=1666986872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Town's Stranger is a world where you can make barns for agriculture and livestock for organic products. You can also set up your restaurant so your customers can experience it by selling the products you produce on your farm and barn.   <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972810/extras/eeb78cecdbf42ceb6907f68a55b0d090.poster.avif?t=1666986872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972810/extras/eeb78cecdbf42ceb6907f68a55b0d090.webm?t=1666986872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972810/extras/eeb78cecdbf42ceb6907f68a55b0d090.mp4?t=1666986872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br> In addition, solving the mystery in the town will be one of your missions, which will allow you to see the other side of the town. You can prepare the items, weapons, products necessary for your tasks and town work on your craft table or get them from the townspeople with whom you have developed your relationships.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972810/extras/b1d301f18b6ad5a685520af28256f2d3.poster.avif?t=1666986872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972810/extras/b1d301f18b6ad5a685520af28256f2d3.webm?t=1666986872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972810/extras/b1d301f18b6ad5a685520af28256f2d3.mp4?t=1666986872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br> If dealing with all this work challenges you, you can hire strong people from the town and make them do some of the responsibilities you need to do. However, we advise you not to forget to pay their salaries.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972810/extras/62f57bf7b64de6588144fec3ef557a3a.poster.avif?t=1666986872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972810/extras/62f57bf7b64de6588144fec3ef557a3a.webm?t=1666986872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972810/extras/62f57bf7b64de6588144fec3ef557a3a.mp4?t=1666986872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Town's Stranger is a world where you can make barns for agriculture and livestock for organic products. You can also set up your restaurant so your customers can experience it by selling the products you produce on your farm and barn.   <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972810/extras/eeb78cecdbf42ceb6907f68a55b0d090.poster.avif?t=1666986872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972810/extras/eeb78cecdbf42ceb6907f68a55b0d090.webm?t=1666986872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972810/extras/eeb78cecdbf42ceb6907f68a55b0d090.mp4?t=1666986872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br> In addition, solving the mystery in the town will be one of your missions, which will allow you to see the other side of the town. You can prepare the items, weapons, products necessary for your tasks and town work on your craft table or get them from the townspeople with whom you have developed your relationships.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972810/extras/b1d301f18b6ad5a685520af28256f2d3.poster.avif?t=1666986872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972810/extras/b1d301f18b6ad5a685520af28256f2d3.webm?t=1666986872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/972810/extras/b1d301f18b6ad5a685520af28256f2d3.mp4?t=1666986872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br> If dealing with all this work challenges you, you can hire strong people from the town and make them do some of the responsibilities you need to do. However, we advise you not to forget to pay their salaries.",
    "short_description": "In Town's Stranger we have to discover the mysterious events that caught our attention in the town. This may not be as cute a town as it seems, so we have to be careful and we can grow organic produces, open restaurant and earn money to make a living.",
